## Upstream material and provenance

The patch files modify the upstream i915 source file
`drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gem/i915_gem_pages.c`. That source file is marked
`SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT` in Linux v6.12 and FreeBSD drm-kmod's
`drm_v6.12.85` source. Its original copyright and MIT notice remain applicable
and must be preserved.

The newly authored patch additions, regression test program, test runner,
Makefile, and project documentation are also offered under MIT by this
repository's contributors. This is a license for the project-authored
contributions; it does not change the provenance or license of upstream code.

No GPL relicensing is intended. Do not remove or replace upstream copyright
notices when applying or redistributing the patches.
